    "title": "AI Reshaping Learning at St. X - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Craig Byrd ,\n1 days ago Artificial intelligence has quickly become one of the most talked-about tools in education — especially when it is used ethically by students and teachers at St. X. Coach Jefferson, a math teacher at St. X, says that AI can be used both for good and bad. In math, using A.I. can make it hard to ensure you are using it in an ethical way and not just cheating. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
